# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a temporary
#  directory before pyinstaller writes the .exe file (also a common
#  reason for antivirus false positives).  They are also sometimes
#  committed to the repository by accident.  Adding the following files
#  to the repository is a bad idea, so add them to the git ignore list.
#  PyInstaller creates a build directory and a spec file in the project
#  root, and an executable file in the root of the dist directory, so the
#  generated files and folders are:
build/
*.spec
*.exe

# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

